    //   C[i][j]   -> C_param(j, i)
    //   A[i][k]   -> A_param(k, i)
    //   A[j][k]   -> A_param(k, j)
    //
    // We construct a single Func "syrk" that:
    //   1. Starts from the original C (copy-in).
    //   2. Scales the lower triangle by beta.
    //   3. Accumulates alpha * A * A^T into the lower triangle.
    //
    // The upper triangle (j > i) must remain unchanged.

